#!/bin/sh
# Register Halo with LuCI: Halo follows the browser's light/dark setting,
# Halo Dark and Halo Light pin one. A fresh install makes Halo the active
# theme (as luci-theme-bootstrap does for itself); an upgrade leaves the
# user's choice alone.
changed=0

set_opt() {
	if ! uci -q get "luci.$1" >/dev/null 2>&1; then
		uci set "luci.$1=$2"
		changed=1
	fi
}

set_opt themes.Halo /luci-static/halo

if [ "$PKG_UPGRADE" != 1 ] && [ $changed = 1 ]; then
	uci set luci.main.mediaurlbase=/luci-static/halo
fi

set_opt themes.HaloDark /luci-static/halo-dark
set_opt themes.HaloLight /luci-static/halo-light

[ $changed = 1 ] && uci commit luci
exit 0
